                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#02a376"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " Increasing awareness of climate change and air pollution drives customers to choose EVs, as they produce zero tailpipe emissions and contribute to reducing urban air pollution.",
